        "review_body": "I find the website not exactly user friendly.  For instance, if I saw a pair of pants in an ad yesterday and only thought to look them up today, I find it hard to find them again.  Also, why can't you make more items in Petite?  Even in the styles that do have a Petite, it's only in a color or two.  I bet that there are a lot more short people out there than you think.  As a Baby Boomer, I find that as I age, I'm losing height and there is a large portion of the population that is in this Baby Boomer category.  You would be wise to make more Petites in all colors.",
